## Conclusion

This project demonstrates the process of building a basic SOC home lab using Splunk Enterprise. Authentication events generated from Metasploitable were forwarded to Splunk through the Universal Forwarder, where they were indexed, searched, and used to create a detection alert. The lab provided hands-on experience with log collection, SIEM monitoring, event analysis, and alert creation, closely reflecting the workflow of a Tier 1 SOC analyst.

